---
export const prerender = true;
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
---

<Content
  kicker="Legal"
  title="Grievance Redressal"
  description="How to file a complaint with Saathum's Grievance Officer — contact details, what to include, and the timelines we follow."
  image="/og/grievance.png"
  lead="How to raise a formal complaint about Saathum, and the timelines we work to."
  updated="2026-08-28"
>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.94faef7412cc15e5">This page is published by</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.b321f789aa69e114">Saathum</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.4da6d34d824c2119">. It sets out how to contact our Grievance Officer, how to
    file a complaint, and the timelines we are required to meet.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-grievance.6182fb738ba3aaf2">1. Grievance Officer</h2>
  <div class="note">
    <p><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.2683cad48a14dc3f">Name:</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.2b86f84238d8832e">Depika Singh</ui-copy></p>
    <p><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.9bc6e88c84f582de">Designation:</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.6c1f2ee26689f94a">Grievance Officer</ui-copy></p>
    <p><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.17507dcf845793fa">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@saathum.com">support@saathum.com</a></p>
    <p><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.7cda1dde3062e1dd">Published by:</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.f3ff6d49bc1573cc">Saathum</ui-copy></p>
    <p><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.edd582232d554613">Hours:</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.f113a46c751e6d50">Monday to Friday, excluding public holidays</ui-copy></p>
  </div>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.5174a2761f8bb0c4">The Grievance Officer is a member of the Saathum team. Complaints sent to</ui-copy>
    <a href="mailto:support@saathum.com">support@saathum.com</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.5dd7e5f90e202637">reach the Grievance Officer
    directly and are handled under the timelines below.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-grievance.3f5e77e028a124e0">2. What you can complain about</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-grievance.8ff38880d3915308">You can use this channel to complain about:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.120ecaa64b77b5ff">Content on Saathum that you believe is unlawful, or that breaches our</ui-copy>
      <a data-i18n="web-grievance.5e0f74c160500cbf" href="/community-guidelines">Community Guidelines</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.7175517a370b5cd2">or</ui-copy>
      <a data-i18n="web-grievance.34aa287a1fcdb9ee" href="/acceptable-use">Acceptable Use Policy</a>.</li>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.da8747136e364e2d">Content that infringes your intellectual property — you can also use our</ui-copy>
      <a data-i18n="web-grievance.0606b89431ebdb4b" href="/dmca">DMCA / Copyright</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.06515066a9e85744">process.</ui-copy></li>
    <li data-i18n="web-grievance.8532319bc691f730">Content that exposes your private information, impersonates you, or is otherwise
      defamatory, obscene, or invasive of your privacy.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-grievance.01e8419f7f028b31">Intimate or sexual imagery of you shared without your consent, including morphed or
      AI-generated imagery — see the expedited timeline in section 4.</li>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.5410959088c099b1">Content or conduct involving a child — see also our</ui-copy>
      <a data-i18n="web-grievance.38dcbb4c298d7d4a" href="/child-safety">Child Safety Standards</a>.</li>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.7fd30d83ac2026da">How we have handled your personal data — see our</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-grievance.506ff394621596dd" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-grievance.4b5a60c653c11488">A decision we took on your account, content, listing, or payout, if you have already tried
      support and are not satisfied.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-grievance.becb5f1e3cd50c86">How our service is functioning, or non-compliance by us with these Rules.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-grievance.21b42199b5f2519b">3. How to file a complaint</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.969ccbd3cf6300ec">Email</ui-copy> <a href="mailto:support@saathum.com">support@saathum.com</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.d92001ce513a29bb">with the subject line</ui-copy>
    <em data-i18n="web-grievance.b86338668207bca0">Grievance</em><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.e6a23a91181bae06">. Include as much of the following as you can — an incomplete complaint takes
    longer, because we have to come back to you for the missing pieces.</ui-copy>
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.a204943256ea6967">Your</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.3409ef498120804f">full name</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.44359e21492d7881">and the</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.8947b7e3832e62b7">email address and phone number</strong>
      <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.340dc094072f9c81">linked to your Saathum account, if you have one.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.213b84010ce537f3">A clear</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.5221b6e00c2e971c">description of the complaint</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.27a6fb90924d8536">and what harm it is causing.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.b344d80e24a36799">The</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.d252a33d493609c6">exact location</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.9872df4f5545e88c">of the content — a link, the account handle, the group
      or chat, and the approximate date and time.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.3bcb437442254dd0">Screenshots or other evidence</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.45f0738db9456b2c">, where you have them.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.b344d80e24a36799">The</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.58fd90763bb7745c">relief you are seeking</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.b5722ec554de2282">— for example removal of a specific item, or
      restoration of your account.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.43f250dfaba65b8f">Where you are complaining about content that concerns you personally, a statement that the
      information you have given is</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.b1250e5c9d567302">true and accurate</strong>.</li>
    <li><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.85d5124a6255d779">If you are complaining on someone else's behalf, your</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.8f76fd501bb68ef7">authority</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.9a4ea6fb4e1d2534">to do
      so.</ui-copy></li>
  </ul>
  <p data-i18n="web-grievance.7093dea22777ecc1">
    Please send one complaint per issue. Sending the same complaint repeatedly does not speed it up
    and makes the record harder to follow.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-grievance.395a96ce18b5fd2f">4. Timelines</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-grievance.b3a2f77ce91d1234">Under the IT Rules, 2021 we will:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th data-i18n="web-grievance.de838855e4a6e04e">Stage</th><th data-i18n="web-grievance.9dcff98e275f0cb9">Timeline</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td data-i18n="web-grievance.a0fe822a7ca940f4">Acknowledge your complaint</td>
        <td><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.fda2336f86f845e1">Within 24 hours</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.679847c77272e78f">of receiving it</ui-copy></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td data-i18n="web-grievance.493dd03a305f9935">Dispose of (resolve) the complaint</td>
        <td><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.1175387f5cc0f722">Within 15 days</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.679847c77272e78f">of receiving it</ui-copy></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td data-i18n="web-grievance.d8788de8230320fb">Act on a complaint about non-consensual intimate imagery — nudity, a sexual act, or
          impersonation in an electronic form, including morphed or artificially generated images
        </td>
        <td><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.fda2336f86f845e1">Within 24 hours</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.8e5a21d241e52d1b">of receiving the complaint</ui-copy></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td data-i18n="web-grievance.2a2c21364eabf95e">Act on a valid order from a court or an authorised government agency</td>
        <td data-i18n="web-grievance.8414846830aa5883">Within the period the order or the law specifies</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p data-i18n="web-grievance.abd7b37033b1201d">
    The 24-hour category is deliberately fast because the harm is immediate. If your complaint
    falls into it, say so clearly in the subject line and the first paragraph so it is not missed.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-grievance.8f83d5faf37aeee2">
    Where a complaint requires more information from you, the clock on resolution is affected by
    how quickly we get it. We will tell you what we need.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-grievance.5564eb7646bfeda9">5. What happens after you file</h2>
  <ol>
    <li data-i18n="web-grievance.e24b6fa16ae12988">You receive an acknowledgement with a reference number.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-grievance.404ba08c7cb8f4bd">We review the complaint against our policies and applicable law, and look at the content or
      account concerned where we can access it.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-grievance.2afcbc49310ee53d">We take action where the complaint is made out — which may mean removing or disabling
      access to content, restricting or terminating an account, correcting information, or
      explaining why no action is warranted.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-grievance.c991f4e8859b3b90">We write to you with the outcome and the reasons for it.</li>
  </ol>
  <p data-i18n="web-grievance.2fefc07525de3ba3">
    Some content on Saathum is private to its participants and not accessible to us. Where that is
    the case, we act on the account-level information available to us and preserve and disclose
    what we lawfully hold when required by valid legal process.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-grievance.e3785b81e205132b">6. Escalation</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-grievance.0d33f37f17eb41e4">
    If you are not satisfied with the outcome, reply to the same email thread with your reference
    number and tell us why, and the Grievance Officer will review it again.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-grievance.e67e4518d1470758">
    If you remain dissatisfied, you may pursue whatever remedies are available to you under
    applicable law or through the appropriate court or authority. Nothing on this page limits your
    legal rights.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-grievance.1b0987925c4d930a">7. Users worldwide</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.3ffa062d4f78d1cb">This grievance mechanism applies to everyone
    regardless of where you are. The fastest route is</ui-copy>
    <a href="mailto:support@saathum.com">support@saathum.com</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.3f8237daf788e43a">; privacy requests go to</ui-copy>
    <a href="mailto:support@saathum.com">support@saathum.com</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.f8d96828d941c7e8">. Complaints about serious harm will be
    actioned wherever they come from.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-grievance.162e9cec43e71c9c">8. Other contacts</h2>
  <div class="note">
    <p><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.2d32985406224528">General support:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@saathum.com">support@saathum.com</a></p>
    <p><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.fee4d83f4dd53670">Privacy and data requests:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@saathum.com">support@saathum.com</a></p>
    <p><strong data-i18n="web-grievance.8b4c1f78cf5009b4">Anything else:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@saathum.com">support@saathum.com</a></p>
    <p>
      <strong data-i18n="web-grievance.7a0a2189d970d668">If someone is in immediate danger, contact your local emergency services first.</strong>
      <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.65683e5daf1e4c9d">Saathum is not an emergency service.</ui-copy>
    </p>
  </div>

  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.4b7b0dc0675899a7">See also our</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-grievance.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>, <a data-i18n="web-grievance.506ff394621596dd" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>,
    <a data-i18n="web-grievance.5e0f74c160500cbf" href="/community-guidelines">Community Guidelines</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-grievance.4aa9bfd2f175a94a">, and</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-grievance.34aa287a1fcdb9ee" href="/acceptable-use">Acceptable Use Policy</a>.
  </p>
</Content>
